[step] Required 1 mm counterbores requested by Derek: each Ø6.2 recess provides the flat seat for a Ø5.5 socket head, leaving a 2.36 mm bearing floor and 2 mm of visible head above the plate. These are the four deliberate fastener seats of the selected mount.
alternatives: Removing the counterbores loses the requested head seats. A 3 mm-deep flush counterbore leaves only 0.36 mm beneath the head; thickening the entire plate for flush heads changes the requested protruding-head design.
